    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>UPDATE WITH YOUR FEEDBACK</h1><p>We appreciate your feedback, with it we change the game for better:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">We created a new game design, now the game is more like hexagon nonogram</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113370/extras/ee1e005ecf17483631011c650f29bdf5.avif?t=1663018150\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">For this, all levels have been recreated:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The game continue with 240 levels<br></li><li>The levels are separeted in 6 difficult modes<br></li><li>The levels is no more randomic<br></li><li>Each level create images and pictures</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Other changes that you requested:</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113370/extras/4d3b0019856ad97ada97ade09e0ef737.avif?t=1663018150\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Now you can click on right mouse button to select a &quot;negative&quot; cell<br></li><li>Now you can click on the column to highlight it<br></li><li>Now you can resize the window mode<br></li><li>A game tutorial to learn hexagon picross</li></ul><br>UPDATE CALENDAR:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>September 1st: New Game Design with 3x3x3 and 4x4x4 levels<br></li><li>September 2nd: 5x5x5 Levels and tutorial<br></li><li>September 5nd: 7x7x7 Levels<br></li><li>September 7nd: 6x6x6 Levels<br></li><li>September 19nd: 9x9x9 Levels</li></ul><br>For more suggestions, you can use the game community to contact us<br>We hope you always have a good experience with our games</p><br><h1>Add to wishlist</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113370/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1663018150\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113370/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1663018150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113370/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1663018150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113370/extras/e4a230f2f4303019aa6e9e16f8e3c710.avif?t=1663018150\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beautiful minimalist design and a relaxing atmosphere</h2><br>Hex Picross was assembled with a beautiful and relaxing minimalist design<br>Made with relaxing visual and sound effects<br>In addition to music prepared exclusively<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to play</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113370/extras/7226b9ffa946db19d8cbd352a2cb7dd9.poster.avif?t=1663018150\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113370/extras/7226b9ffa946db19d8cbd352a2cb7dd9.webm?t=1663018150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113370/extras/7226b9ffa946db19d8cbd352a2cb7dd9.mp4?t=1663018150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You need to click on the hexagonal cells to make them colored<br>Each diagonal and column counts how many colored cells there are<br>Your challenge is to find all the intersections between columns and diagonals<br>With this, they will decrease their number and will be equal to zero.<br>When all are equal to zero, you've won the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Many Difficulty  Levels</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3x3x3 - 40 Levels<br></li><li>4x4x4 - 40 Levels<br></li><li>5x5x5 - 40 Levels<br></li><li>6x6x6 - 40 Levels<br></li><li>7x7x7- 40 Levels<br></li><li>9x9x9 - 40 Levels</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Resources</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Minimalist: no timer and no pressure, solve puzzles in your own time<br></li><li>Premium: 240 carefully chosen levels<br></li><li>Zen: Zen and relaxing sound environment<br></li><li>Dark Mode: Perfect if you can't stare at the white screen for too long<br></li><li>Steam Cloud and Steam Achivements</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113370/extras/e4a230f2f4303019aa6e9e16f8e3c710.avif?t=1663018150\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beautiful minimalist design and a relaxing atmosphere</h2><br>Hex Picross was assembled with a beautiful and relaxing minimalist design<br>Made with relaxing visual and sound effects<br>In addition to music prepared exclusively<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to play</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113370/extras/7226b9ffa946db19d8cbd352a2cb7dd9.poster.avif?t=1663018150\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113370/extras/7226b9ffa946db19d8cbd352a2cb7dd9.webm?t=1663018150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113370/extras/7226b9ffa946db19d8cbd352a2cb7dd9.mp4?t=1663018150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You need to click on the hexagonal cells to make them colored<br>Each diagonal and column counts how many colored cells there are<br>Your challenge is to find all the intersections between columns and diagonals<br>With this, they will decrease their number and will be equal to zero.<br>When all are equal to zero, you've won the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Many Difficulty  Levels</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3x3x3 - 40 Levels<br></li><li>4x4x4 - 40 Levels<br></li><li>5x5x5 - 40 Levels<br></li><li>6x6x6 - 40 Levels<br></li><li>7x7x7- 40 Levels<br></li><li>9x9x9 - 40 Levels</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Resources</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Minimalist: no timer and no pressure, solve puzzles in your own time<br></li><li>Premium: 240 carefully chosen levels<br></li><li>Zen: Zen and relaxing sound environment<br></li><li>Dark Mode: Perfect if you can't stare at the white screen for too long<br></li><li>Steam Cloud and Steam Achivements</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hex PiCross is a picross game built on a hexagonal grid with a beautiful minimalist design and a uniquely prepared soundscape. Click to color the hexagonal cells so that all columns and diagonals are zero.",
